[ti:Amazing Grace]
[ar:Traditional]
[al:Public Domain]

[00:00.00]
[00:06.00]Amazing grace, how sweet the sound
[00:12.50]That saved a wretch like me
[00:19.00]I once was lost, but now am found
[00:25.50]Was blind, but now I see
[00:32.00]
[00:38.00]'Twas grace that taught my heart to fear
[00:44.50]And grace my fears relieved
[00:51.00]How precious did that grace appear
[00:57.50]The hour I first believed
[01:04.00]
